15.Challenges and Solutions
Cross-module integrity is managed through ID checks and enrollment/loan conditions.
Duplicate enrollments and capacity overflow are rejected.
Book inventory availability changes during issue/return.
Indexes are rebuilt after vector mutations to keep index positions consistent.
Binary Search is only run after ID sorting.
